    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos, Reed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the city gates, the nomad looks back at the citadel in the distance one last time."
    },
    {
        "text": "She resists the urge to turn tail and flee at the acrid burning smell. She knows what it signifies."
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows she should do as Nemos said, and leave the city to seek the wakemen as quickly as possible, regardless of whether Loughshinny is successful."
    },
    {
        "text": "But despite the urgency in Nemos's voice, she did not sound like she believed things would take a turn for the better, nor did she believe that Brigid could convince the wakemen to come."
    },
    {
        "text": "Brigid could smell the same burning smell coming from Nemos. It reminded her of the obsessions that only the dead could have."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you waiting for? Death? Are you just waiting for it to pat you on the back so you can have a nice little race together?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who is that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#4$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. I forgot you could hear me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#4$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can hear you. I can even sense your presence... but I can't see you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave the city, outsider.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're an outsider too, by the sound of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally. Consider it advice from one outsider to another.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#5$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Live, Brigid. Nothing is more important than being alive. This city will be dead by sunrise tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen to Nemos. Find her kinsmen, run as far as you can, and never look back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You're right. I should go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I <i>will</i> be back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#7$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#4$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah! Stubbornness and stupidity really <i>are</i> hereditary!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going to come back after she tried so hard to get you out of here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you also think it was just an excuse to keep me safe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What else could it be? You really think you can sway those wood-brains? Maybe if you waited for spring, one of their brains would sprout and they might come with you to the Dark Woods!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like the way you talk, invisible brother.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#2$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you call me? Brother?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#2$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have burnt stench, but other than that, you remind me of the nomads. No clue how you're related to us, but it feels right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#4$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... hahahahaha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#11$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's make a bet then, Brigid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#11$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "A bet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "On whether you'll be back tonight, before Na Saoirs\u00ed is burned to the ground. I say it's impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what you really want to bet on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yeah? Then tell me, what I'm really thinking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "You just want to prove that you're right, that nothing is more important than being alive. You think I'll choose survival in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "But whatever. You're on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#4$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, what are you waiting for then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#4$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "It just doesn't feel fair. If you win, I'll live the rest of my life in regret. But if I win, it doesn't really matter to a bystander like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "So how about this? If I win, you go back to where you came from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "And where do you think I should go back to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#8$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "No idea, but not here. This isn't your home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sound like you've been betrayed by the cityfolk here before, but you still can't bring yourself to hurt them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "You act like you want to see them reap what they sowed, but didn't sound happy at all when you talked about the city burning to the ground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honestly, you're the most struggling person I ever met, and\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#6$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1690_1#6$1",
        "afrom": 0.5,
        "ato": 0.5,
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
