    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "59_i09",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.2,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 35,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. If you win, I'll return to where I belong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "But just coming back here to die won't cut it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "What else do you need me to do then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "Deliver a message to those wood-brains outside the city. Tell them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Ancient Tengae) 'It's been six hundred years. Nobody's blaming you anymore. Go do your jobs.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, and one more thing. (Ancient Tengae) 'I *Ancient Tengae expletive* you stupid wood-brains!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pass that on to those fools verbatim, <i>especially</i> the filthier bits. Did you get all that? Need me to repeat myself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-No, the elders sometimes speak that language, so I understand it, more or less...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you waiting for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was all of that just so you could tell me this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brigid"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Just get moving already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "The golden-haired nomad takes a deep breath and runs away from the city."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her ancestor whose figure she never saw stands in place, unmoving."
    },
    {
        "text": "That stubbornness and stupidity...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "text": "...really are hereditary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Exiled King"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
