        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "*pant*... *pant*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Made it in time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "She raises her spear toward the mist outside, lighting a bright yellow spark in the city of purple."
    },
    {
        "text": "As though receiving some kind of message, the mist slowly rises until it is level with the flame at the tip of her spear."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, come here, where it's warm and bright, where there's still life... yes, over here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? You want to pretend I don't exist again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't let you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "This light will never go out, not until true darkness falls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodcracle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fireburst",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.5,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.01,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Attracted by the flame in her hand, yet unable to approach, the mist begins to flow through the streets."
    },
    {
        "text": "Soon, it returns. But this time, her flame can neither draw or repel it."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is a cacophony within the mist. She feels as though everything has gone dark all of a sudden\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.3,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.05,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect",
        "name": "$eb_blacksmoke_01",
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "The dark mist has come."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Is this your answer?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, this is my answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is incomplete. It needs time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Time is your enemy, not your friend.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll see about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The deathly fires have not yet completely transformed the people into the walking dead. They're still alive. There is still time to return the flames.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're not going anywhere until Nemos awakens them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Ridiculous.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ridiculous? Maybe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe my strength, my wisdom, and my Arts are all so insignificant to you that it seems ridiculous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I have my resolve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Loughshinny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
