        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$distressed_intro",
        "key": "$distressed_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nemos drags the coffin through the corridor."
    },
    {
        "text": "The red dragon's remains do not burn. They simply lie there quietly."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is how death should be. But Nemos seems to hear an ethereal voice laughing in her ear."
    },
    {
        "text": "Without hesitation, the wayward wakewoman lifts the limp body and tosses it into the coffin."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This coffin, red dragon, is your final resting place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's where those like you belong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "So where are you now? Are you still watching us from somewhere, with that twisted smile of yours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this vessel, at least, is beyond your reach. Otherwise, you'd have burned me to ash by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this spear, which never left your side... How many times have you breathed your flames from it, and how many others like Culann have been your victims?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't even know the answer, do you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "With great effort, Nemos lifts the spear and thrusts it into the coffin."
    },
    {
        "text": "Flames from its tip engulf the coffin in an instant, spreading along the rope connecting it to Nemos and merging with the purple fire on her."
    },
    {
        "text": "A deathly cold runs through Nemos's body, but she could hardly feel temperature at this point."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're mine now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll finish what Culann started.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, to those lowly, despicable places that suffered from the war you stole victory in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will be seen by all. Your death will be seen by all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "They will know that you are dead. That the proud, imperious red dragon is dead. 'Here lies Eblana Dublinn, in this coffin covered in freezing flames.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... what will they do then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I pray that your death will wake them up, of course, as Loughshinny hoped.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "That they'll know that the era you represented is over. That Na Saoirs\u00ed will escape this calamity. That Tara need not celebrate its rebirth with the death of a city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... heh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your fire must have gotten to my head, dragon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is that I suddenly feel like the other ending... where it all ends in destruction... isn't so bad?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone else may have killed you, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1692_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>This</i> is my revenge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nemos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The coffin remains silent, and Nemos no longer speaks."
    },
    {
        "text": "Silent, delirious, and determined, she drags the burning coffin down the stairs, making a point to let it hit each step on the way down."
    },
    {
        "text": "It sounds like the withered mockery of the dead."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
